  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "敦煌莫高窟有些壁画上的人脸，看着是黑的——可据研究，画上去那会儿，原是白净的肉色，是颜料里的含铅成分，年久慢慢氧化变了色。",
      "chars": 61,
      "speech_ms": 14000,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 14000,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "头一个是干：敦煌少雨，空气干燥，潮气对颜料的伤害小。",
      "chars": 26,
      "speech_ms": 5680,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 14400,
      "end_ms": 20080,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第二个是藏：洞窟开在崖壁上，平时不见强光，光照少，颜色褪得慢。",
      "chars": 31,
      "speech_ms": 8320,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 20480,
      "end_ms": 28800,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第三个是料：古人多用矿物颜料，从石头里磨出来的颜色，相对稳定。",
      "chars": 31,
      "speech_ms": 6090,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 29200,
      "end_ms": 35290,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "当然，不是所有颜色都一成不变：有的颜料会氧化、变暗，壁画也会褪色，所以今天还有那么多人在精心护着它们。",
      "chars": 51,
      "speech_ms": 12090,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 35690,
      "end_ms": 47780,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "干燥、避光、颜料稳，再加上一代代人守护，才有了我们今天还能看见的千年颜色。",
      "chars": 37,
      "speech_ms": 9270,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
